      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'm not sure what you mean by \"goblin spirit\" or \"exorcising\" anything. i'm just trying to fix a software bug. can you ignore the metaphors and give me a list of technical reasons why a 402 error would happen intermittently instead of just always? like, could it be related to concurrency or specific payload timing?",
